            <profile id="7ba1-bf56-8b78-e73c" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fc9f-8438-629b-e92d" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword and shield. Javelins or throwing spear +2; if on foot heavy throwing spear +3; light armour +3. May ride a horse (free). Army General, Stubborn. If no Army General is taken the commander must be a Heroic Leader. (Hannibal p.71)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="b1d4-094b-b14e-5953" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
