              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, throwing spear, shield. Feigned Flight (lost if armed with heavy throwing spears), Stealth. One unit may be Stubborn (+3 per figure). (Hannibal p.71)</characteristic>
