              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword and sling. Skirmishers, Warband. May not outnumber any other skirmishing infantry unit in the army. Every other unit may be Balearic Slingers. (Hannibal p.72)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
